# Aurorae recolor map: Monochrome (Patrik Wyde) -> Gorgoroth (Black Metal).
#
# Format: <old-hex> <new-hex>   # role
# Consumed by:
#   recolor.sh -> applies the hex map to the decoration SVGs and the same
#                 colours as RGB triplets (r,g,b) to the theme rc file
#   verify.sh  -> fails if any non-identity old hex or RGB triplet survives
#
# Rules:
#   - identity pairs (old == new) are never substituted and never flagged
#   - *TextShadowColor=255,255,255,255 is functional in the upstream theme
#     (same category as Kvantum's #ff00ff marker): the RGB pass would turn it
#     into the text colour, so recolor.sh restores it afterwards and verify.sh
#     does not flag 255,255,255
#
# Gorgoroth ladder: 000000 bg · c1c1c1 foreground · 8a4f4f negative.

1e1e20 000000   # window background -> pure black
ffffff c1c1c1   # brightest glyphs -> foreground
bebebe c1c1c1   # bright gray -> foreground
aaaaac c1c1c1   # text
78787a 888888   # inactive text / tabs
464648 505050   # active focused tab color
da4453 8a4f4f   # negative red
000000 000000   # identity: pure black
